= A Government Shutdown

The government has partially shut down in a fight over border-wall funding. Hundreds of thousands of federal workers are unpaid.

- @shutdown_hold: Hold the line
- @shutdown_deal: Seek a quick deal

@shutdown_hold
on-arrival: working_dem += 2*(1-dissent); suburban_dem += 2*(1-dissent); dem_enthusiasm += 0.5; progressive_dissent -= 2; polarization += 1

The public blames the president for the shutdown.

@shutdown_deal
on-arrival: gopmod_relation += 3; moderate_strength += 1; progressive_dissent += 3; dem_enthusiasm -= 0.2

Federal workers return to work, with little to show for the fight.
